{"id":"80c210450e512314","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-galois-representation.md","title":"Galois Representation","display":"df-galois-representation — Galois Representation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-galois-representation","aliases":["58-df-galois-representation","Galois Representation"],"display":"df-galois-representation — Galois Representation","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-galois-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-galois-representation</span><span>Galois Representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-galois-representation — Galois Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dac0596ff0a0af4a\" href=\"?note=dac0596ff0a0af4a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md\">../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,n,E,\\rho,\\tau_G,\\tau_{n,E}\\in V\">\\(G,n,E,\\rho,\\tau_G,\\tau_{n,E}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\in V\\)</span> (the explicitly constructed invertible-matrix carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S\\)</span> (Galois-group carrier relation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dac0596ff0a0af4a\" href=\"?note=dac0596ff0a0af4a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md\">../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (five-place continuity relation; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S\\)</span> (Galois-representation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}galois\\text{-}rep}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S\n(\\rho,G,n,E,\\tau_G,\\tau_{n,E})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\overline K,K,\\sigma_{\\overline K},\n+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,\n\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},I_{n,E},\\star_{n,E},1_G\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S\n(G;\\overline K,K,\\sigma_{\\overline K})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land I_{n,E}\\in E^{n\\times n}\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\n\\Bigl(\ni=j\\to I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\n\\Bigl(\ni\\ne j\\to I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=0_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\n=\\Bigl\\{A\\in E^{n\\times n}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\exists B\\in E^{n\\times n}\\;\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{k\\in n}A(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EB(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n=I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{67mm}\\land\n\\sum_{k\\in n}B(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EA(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n=I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\star_{n,E}\n=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle A,B\\rangle,C\\rangle\n\\in(\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\n\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\forall i,j\\in n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\nC(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n=\\sum_{k\\in n}A(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EB(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\star_{n,E},\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},\n\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land1_G=\n\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\overline K\\}\n\\land1_G\\in G\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\n\\land\\rho(1_G)=I_{n,E}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\eta\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\rho(\\sigma\\circ\\eta)\n=\\rho(\\sigma)\\star_{n,E}\\rho(\\eta)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\n(\\rho,G,\\tau_G,\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},\\tau_{n,E})\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}galois\\text{-}rep}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S\n(\\rho,G,n,E,\\tau_G,\\tau_{n,E})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\overline K,K,\\sigma_{\\overline K},\n+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,\n\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},I_{n,E},\\star_{n,E},1_G\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S\n(G;\\overline K,K,\\sigma_{\\overline K})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land I_{n,E}\\in E^{n\\times n}\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\n\\Bigl(\ni=j\\to I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\n\\Bigl(\ni\\ne j\\to I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=0_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\n=\\Bigl\\{A\\in E^{n\\times n}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\exists B\\in E^{n\\times n}\\;\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{k\\in n}A(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EB(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n=I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{67mm}\\land\n\\sum_{k\\in n}B(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EA(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n=I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\star_{n,E}\n=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle A,B\\rangle,C\\rangle\n\\in(\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\n\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\forall i,j\\in n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\nC(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n=\\sum_{k\\in n}A(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EB(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\star_{n,E},\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},\n\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land1_G=\n\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\overline K\\}\n\\land1_G\\in G\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\n\\land\\rho(1_G)=I_{n,E}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\eta\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\rho(\\sigma\\circ\\eta)\n=\\rho(\\sigma)\\star_{n,E}\\rho(\\eta)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\n(\\rho,G,\\tau_G,\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},\\tau_{n,E})\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Galois group is selected by its registered four-place carrier relation. The identity automorphism, invertible-matrix carrier, identity matrix, and matrix multiplication graph are all constructed in the assertion.</li>\n<li>Continuity receives the same source and target carriers used by the homomorphism clauses; no undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Gal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GL_n\">\\(GL_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n\">\\(I_n\\)</span>, or overloaded multiplication remains.</li>\n<li>The coefficient field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> may be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q_\\ell\">\\(\\mathbb Q_\\ell\\)</span>, or a finite field, with the corresponding matrix-group topology.</li>\n<li>Frobenius polynomials and compatible systems are downstream constructions, not part of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gelbart, An Elementary Introduction to the Langlands Program</li>\n<li>Harris and Taylor, The Geometry and Cohomology of Some Simple Shimura Varieties&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"dac0596ff0a0af4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S$ (Galois-group carrier relation; see [[../batch20/58-df-galois-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S$ (five-place continuity relation; see [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,n,E,\\rho,\\tau_G,\\tau_{n,E}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}galois\\text{-}rep}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S\n(\\rho,G,n,E,\\tau_G,\\tau_{n,E})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\overline K,K,\\sigma_{\\overline K},\n+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,\n\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},I_{n,E},\\star_{n,E},1_G\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{GaloisGroup}_S\n(G;\\overline K,K,\\sigma_{\\overline K})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land I_{n,E}\\in E^{n\\times n}\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\n\\Bigl(\ni=j\\to I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\n\\Bigl(\ni\\ne j\\to I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=0_E\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\n=\\Bigl\\{A\\in E^{n\\times n}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\exists B\\in E^{n\\times n}\\;\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{k\\in n}A(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EB(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n=I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{67mm}\\land\n\\sum_{k\\in n}B(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EA(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n=I_{n,E}(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\star_{n,E}\n=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle A,B\\rangle,C\\rangle\n\\in(\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\n\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\ \\Bigm|\\ \n\\forall i,j\\in n\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\nC(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\n=\\sum_{k\\in n}A(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\cdot_EB(\\langle k,j\\rangle)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\star_{n,E},\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E}\\times\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},\n\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\\\\\n&\\quad\\land1_G=\n\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\overline K\\}\n\\land1_G\\in G\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E})\n\\land\\rho(1_G)=I_{n,E}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\eta\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\rho(\\sigma\\circ\\eta)\n=\\rho(\\sigma)\\star_{n,E}\\rho(\\eta)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\n(\\rho,G,\\tau_G,\\mathrm{GL}_{n,E},\\tau_{n,E})\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gal}","display":false},{"tex":"GL_n","display":false},{"tex":"I_n","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q_\\ell","display":false}],"bytes":3573,"backlinks":[{"id":"560c33a2a83aebf2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GaloisRepresentation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-galois-representation]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-570","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-galois-representation.md|58-df-galois-representation]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["dac0596ff0a0af4a","1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}